OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'heart of gold' mother
OL,4,Awho died in Fife crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a "heart of
OL,7,Fgold" young woman who died in a
OL,8,Fthree-car crash in Fife earlier this
OL,9,Fmonth.
OL,11,FAisha Kempson, 24, from Cardenden, was
OL,12,Fpronounced dead at the scene of the
OL,13,Fcollision on the A92 in the early hours
OL,14,Fof Sunday 4 October near Luthrie
OL,15,Fjunction.
OL,17,FThe mother of two was a passenger in an
OL,18,FAudi A3. Two other cars, a grey Volvo
OL,19,FV40 and a white Honda HRV were also
OL,20,Finvolved.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
